      "html": "<h2 id=\"_1\">一、定积分的定义</h2>\n<div class=\"math\">\\int_a^b f(x)\\,dx = \\lim_{\\lambda\\to 0}\\sum_{i=1}^n f(\\xi_i)\\Delta x_i</div>\n\n<p>几何意义：曲边梯形的<strong>代数面积</strong>（<span class=\"math\">x</span> 轴上方为正、下方为负）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">二、基本性质</h2>\n<div class=\"math\">\\int_a^b f = -\\int_b^a f, \\qquad \\int_a^a f = 0</div>\n\n<div class=\"math\">\\int_a^b (\\alpha f + \\beta g) = \\alpha\\int_a^b f + \\beta\\int_a^b g</div>\n\n<p><strong>区间可加性</strong>：<span class=\"math\">\\displaystyle\\int_a^b f = \\int_a^c f + \\int_c^b f</span></p>\n<p><strong>保号性</strong>：若 <span class=\"math\">f(x)\\ge 0</span>，则 <span class=\"math\">\\int_a^b f \\ge 0</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>估值定理</strong>：<span class=\"math\">m(b-a) \\le \\int_a^b f \\le M(b-a)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">三、积分中值定理</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math\">f</span> 在 <span class=\"math\">[a,b]</span> 上连续，则存在 <span class=\"math\">\\xi\\in[a,b]</span> 使</p>\n<div class=\"math\">\\int_a^b f(x)\\,dx = f(\\xi)(b-a)</div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_4\">四、变限积分与求导（重点）</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math\">\\Phi(x) = \\displaystyle\\int_a^x f(t)\\,dt</span>，若 <span class=\"math\">f</span> 连续，则</p>\n<div class=\"math\">\\Phi'(x) = f(x)</div>\n\n<p><strong>一般形式</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math\">\\frac{d}{dx}\\int_{u(x)}^{v(x)} f(t)\\,dt = f(v(x))v'(x) - f(u(x))u'(x)</div>\n\n<h2 id=\"-\">五、牛顿-莱布尼茨公式</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math\">F'(x) = f(x)</span> 且 <span class=\"math\">f</span> 在 <span class=\"math\">[a,b]</span> 上连续，则</p>\n<div class=\"math\">\\int_a^b f(x)\\,dx = F(b) - F(a)</div>\n\n<p>这是连接微分与积分的核心公式，把定积分计算转化为求原函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">六、典型例题</h2>\n<p><strong>例 1</strong> 求 <span class=\"math\">\\displaystyle\\int_0^1 x^2\\,dx</span>。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>解</strong>：原函数为 <span class=\"math\">\\frac{x^3}{3}</span>：<br />\n<div class=\"math\">\\int_0^1 x^2 dx = \\frac{1^3}{3} - 0 = \\frac{1}{3}</div></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong>例 2</strong> 求 <span class=\"math\">\\displaystyle\\frac{d}{dx}\\int_0^{x^2}\\sin t\\,dt</span>。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>解</strong>：由变限积分求导公式：<br />\n<div class=\"math\">\\frac{d}{dx}\\int_0^{x^2}\\sin t\\,dt = \\sin(x^2)\\cdot 2x = 2x\\sin(x^2)</div></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">七、易错点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用牛顿-莱布尼茨公式要求 <span class=\"math\">f</span> <strong>在 <span class=\"math\">[a,b]</span> 上连续</strong>；若有瑕点需按反常积分处理</li>\n<li>变限积分求导时<strong>别忘了上限的导数</strong>（链式法则）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">相关笔记</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[[高等数学 · 不定积分：换元与分部]]</li>\n<li>[[高等数学 · 定积分的计算技巧与反常积分]]</li>\n</ul>",
      "md": "## 一、定积分的定义\n\n<div class=\"math\">\\int_a^b f(x)\\,dx = \\lim_{\\lambda\\to 0}\\sum_{i=1}^n f(\\xi_i)\\Delta x_i</div>\n\n几何意义：曲边梯形的**代数面积**（<span class=\"math\">x</span> 轴上方为正、下方为负）。\n\n## 二、基本性质\n\n<div class=\"math\">\\int_a^b f = -\\int_b^a f, \\qquad \\int_a^a f = 0</div>\n\n<div class=\"math\">\\int_a^b (\\alpha f + \\beta g) = \\alpha\\int_a^b f + \\beta\\int_a^b g</div>\n\n**区间可加性**：<span class=\"math\">\\displaystyle\\int_a^b f = \\int_a^c f + \\int_c^b f</span>\n\n**保号性**：若 <span class=\"math\">f(x)\\ge 0</span>，则 <span class=\"math\">\\int_a^b f \\ge 0</span>。\n\n**估值定理**：<span class=\"math\">m(b-a) \\le \\int_a^b f \\le M(b-a)</span>。\n\n## 三、积分中值定理\n\n若 <span class=\"math\">f</span> 在 <span class=\"math\">[a,b]</span> 上连续，则存在 <span class=\"math\">\\xi\\in[a,b]</span> 使\n\n<div class=\"math\">\\int_a^b f(x)\\,dx = f(\\xi)(b-a)</div>\n\n## 四、变限积分与求导（重点）\n\n设 <span class=\"math\">\\Phi(x) = \\displaystyle\\int_a^x f(t)\\,dt</span>，若 <span class=\"math\">f</span> 连续，则\n\n<div class=\"math\">\\Phi'(x) = f(x)</div>\n\n**一般形式**：\n\n<div class=\"math\">\\frac{d}{dx}\\int_{u(x)}^{v(x)} f(t)\\,dt = f(v(x))v'(x) - f(u(x))u'(x)</div>\n\n## 五、牛顿-莱布尼茨公式\n\n若 <span class=\"math\">F'(x) = f(x)</span> 且 <span class=\"math\">f</span> 在 <span class=\"math\">[a,b]</span> 上连续，则\n\n<div class=\"math\">\\int_a^b f(x)\\,dx = F(b) - F(a)</div>\n\n这是连接微分与积分的核心公式，把定积分计算转化为求原函数。\n\n## 六、典型例题\n\n**例 1** 求 <span class=\"math\">\\displaystyle\\int_0^1 x^2\\,dx</span>。\n\n> **解**：原函数为 <span class=\"math\">\\frac{x^3}{3}</span>：\n> <div class=\"math\">\\int_0^1 x^2 dx = \\frac{1^3}{3} - 0 = \\frac{1}{3}</div>\n\n**例 2** 求 <span class=\"math\">\\displaystyle\\frac{d}{dx}\\int_0^{x^2}\\sin t\\,dt</span>。\n\n> **解**：由变限积分求导公式：\n> <div class=\"math\">\\frac{d}{dx}\\int_0^{x^2}\\sin t\\,dt = \\sin(x^2)\\cdot 2x = 2x\\sin(x^2)</div>\n\n## 七、易错点\n\n- 使用牛顿-莱布尼茨公式要求 <span class=\"math\">f</span> **在 <span class=\"math\">[a,b]</span> 上连续**；若有瑕点需按反常积分处理\n- 变限积分求导时**别忘了上限的导数**（链式法则）\n\n## 相关笔记\n\n- [[高等数学 · 不定积分：换元与分部]]\n- [[高等数学 · 定积分的计算技巧与反常积分]]\n"
