      "html": "<h2 id=\"_1\">一、向量的运算</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math\">\\vec{a} = (a_1, a_2, a_3)</span>，<span class=\"math\">\\vec{b} = (b_1, b_2, b_3)</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>数量积（点积）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math\">\\vec{a}\\cdot\\vec{b} = a_1b_1 + a_2b_2 + a_3b_3 = |\\vec{a}||\\vec{b}|\\cos\\theta</div>\n\n<p><strong>向量积（叉积）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math\">\\vec{a}\\times\\vec{b} = \\begin{vmatrix}\\vec{i} & \\vec{j} & \\vec{k} \\\\ a_1 & a_2 & a_3 \\\\ b_1 & b_2 & b_3\\end{vmatrix}, \\qquad |\\vec{a}\\times\\vec{b}| = |\\vec{a}||\\vec{b}|\\sin\\theta</div>\n\n<p><strong>垂直与平行</strong>：<br />\n- <span class=\"math\">\\vec{a} \\perp \\vec{b} \\iff \\vec{a}\\cdot\\vec{b} = 0</span><br />\n- <span class=\"math\">\\vec{a} \\parallel \\vec{b} \\iff \\vec{a}\\times\\vec{b} = \\vec{0}</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">二、平面方程</h2>\n<p><strong>点法式</strong>：过 <span class=\"math\">M_0(x_0,y_0,z_0)</span>，法向量 <span class=\"math\">\\vec{n}=(A,B,C)</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math\">A(x-x_0) + B(y-y_0) + C(z-z_0) = 0</div>\n\n<p><strong>一般式</strong>：<span class=\"math\">Ax + By + Cz + D = 0</span></p>\n<p><strong>点到平面的距离</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math\">d = \\frac{|Ax_0 + By_0 + Cz_0 + D|}{\\sqrt{A^2 + B^2 + C^2}}</div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_3\">三、空间直线方程</h2>\n<p><strong>对称式（点向式）</strong>：过 <span class=\"math\">M_0</span>，方向向量 <span class=\"math\">\\vec{s} = (m,n,p)</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math\">\\frac{x-x_0}{m} = \\frac{y-y_0}{n} = \\frac{z-z_0}{p}</div>\n\n<p><strong>参数式</strong>：<span class=\"math\">x = x_0 + mt</span>，<span class=\"math\">y = y_0 + nt</span>，<span class=\"math\">z = z_0 + pt</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>直线与平面的关系</strong>：<br />\n- 直线 <span class=\"math\">\\perp</span> 平面 <span class=\"math\">\\iff</span> <span class=\"math\">\\vec{s} \\parallel \\vec{n}</span><br />\n- 直线 <span class=\"math\">\\parallel</span> 平面 <span class=\"math\">\\iff</span> <span class=\"math\">\\vec{s}\\cdot\\vec{n} = 0</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">四、常见曲面</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>方程</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>球面</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\">(x-a)^2 + (y-b)^2 + (z-c)^2 = R^2</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>椭球面</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\">\\frac{x^2}{a^2} + \\frac{y^2}{b^2} + \\frac{z^2}{c^2} = 1</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抛物面</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\">z = \\frac{x^2}{a^2} + \\frac{y^2}{b^2}</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>柱面</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\">F(x,y) = 0</span>（母线平行 <span class=\"math\">z</span> 轴）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>圆锥面</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\">z^2 = a^2(x^2 + y^2)</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>旋转曲面</strong>：<span class=\"math\">yOz</span> 面上曲线 <span class=\"math\">f(y,z)=0</span> 绕 <span class=\"math\">z</span> 轴旋转得 <span class=\"math\">f(\\pm\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}, z) = 0</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">五、典型例题</h2>\n<p><strong>例 1</strong> 求过点 <span class=\"math\">(1,2,3)</span> 且垂直于向量 <span class=\"math\">(2,-1,4)</span> 的平面方程。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>解</strong>：法向量即 <span class=\"math\">(2,-1,4)</span>，由点法式：<br />\n<div class=\"math\">2(x-1) - (y-2) + 4(z-3) = 0 \\Rightarrow 2x - y + 4z - 12 = 0</div></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong>例 2</strong> 求点 <span class=\"math\">(1,1,1)</span> 到平面 <span class=\"math\">x + 2y + 2z - 3 = 0</span> 的距离。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>解</strong>：<br />\n<div class=\"math\">d = \\frac{|1 + 2 + 2 - 3|}{\\sqrt{1 + 4 + 4}} = \\frac{2}{3}</div></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">六、易错点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>叉积 <span class=\"math\">\\vec{a}\\times\\vec{b}</span> 与 <span class=\"math\">\\vec{b}\\times\\vec{a}</span> 差一个负号，注意方向</li>\n<li>对称式中分母为 <span class=\"math\">0</span> 时应理解为对应分子为 <span class=\"math\">0</span>，写成比例式需谨慎</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">相关笔记</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[[高等数学 · 高阶线性微分方程]]</li>\n<li>[[高等数学 · 多元函数微分法]]</li>\n</ul>",
      "md": "## 一、向量的运算\n\n设 <span class=\"math\">\\vec{a} = (a_1, a_2, a_3)</span>，<span class=\"math\">\\vec{b} = (b_1, b_2, b_3)</span>。\n\n**数量积（点积）**：\n\n<div class=\"math\">\\vec{a}\\cdot\\vec{b} = a_1b_1 + a_2b_2 + a_3b_3 = |\\vec{a}||\\vec{b}|\\cos\\theta</div>\n\n**向量积（叉积）**：\n\n<div class=\"math\">\\vec{a}\\times\\vec{b} = \\begin{vmatrix}\\vec{i} & \\vec{j} & \\vec{k} \\\\ a_1 & a_2 & a_3 \\\\ b_1 & b_2 & b_3\\end{vmatrix}, \\qquad |\\vec{a}\\times\\vec{b}| = |\\vec{a}||\\vec{b}|\\sin\\theta</div>\n\n**垂直与平行**：\n- <span class=\"math\">\\vec{a} \\perp \\vec{b} \\iff \\vec{a}\\cdot\\vec{b} = 0</span>\n- <span class=\"math\">\\vec{a} \\parallel \\vec{b} \\iff \\vec{a}\\times\\vec{b} = \\vec{0}</span>\n\n## 二、平面方程\n\n**点法式**：过 <span class=\"math\">M_0(x_0,y_0,z_0)</span>，法向量 <span class=\"math\">\\vec{n}=(A,B,C)</span>：\n\n<div class=\"math\">A(x-x_0) + B(y-y_0) + C(z-z_0) = 0</div>\n\n**一般式**：<span class=\"math\">Ax + By + Cz + D = 0</span>\n\n**点到平面的距离**：\n\n<div class=\"math\">d = \\frac{|Ax_0 + By_0 + Cz_0 + D|}{\\sqrt{A^2 + B^2 + C^2}}</div>\n\n## 三、空间直线方程\n\n**对称式（点向式）**：过 <span class=\"math\">M_0</span>，方向向量 <span class=\"math\">\\vec{s} = (m,n,p)</span>：\n\n<div class=\"math\">\\frac{x-x_0}{m} = \\frac{y-y_0}{n} = \\frac{z-z_0}{p}</div>\n\n**参数式**：<span class=\"math\">x = x_0 + mt</span>，<span class=\"math\">y = y_0 + nt</span>，<span class=\"math\">z = z_0 + pt</span>。\n\n**直线与平面的关系**：\n- 直线 <span class=\"math\">\\perp</span> 平面 <span class=\"math\">\\iff</span> <span class=\"math\">\\vec{s} \\parallel \\vec{n}</span>\n- 直线 <span class=\"math\">\\parallel</span> 平面 <span class=\"math\">\\iff</span> <span class=\"math\">\\vec{s}\\cdot\\vec{n} = 0</span>\n\n## 四、常见曲面\n\n| 名称 | 方程 |\n|---|---|\n| 球面 | <span class=\"math\">(x-a)^2 + (y-b)^2 + (z-c)^2 = R^2</span> |\n| 椭球面 | <span class=\"math\">\\frac{x^2}{a^2} + \\frac{y^2}{b^2} + \\frac{z^2}{c^2} = 1</span> |\n| 抛物面 | <span class=\"math\">z = \\frac{x^2}{a^2} + \\frac{y^2}{b^2}</span> |\n| 柱面 | <span class=\"math\">F(x,y) = 0</span>（母线平行 <span class=\"math\">z</span> 轴） |\n| 圆锥面 | <span class=\"math\">z^2 = a^2(x^2 + y^2)</span> |\n\n**旋转曲面**：<span class=\"math\">yOz</span> 面上曲线 <span class=\"math\">f(y,z)=0</span> 绕 <span class=\"math\">z</span> 轴旋转得 <span class=\"math\">f(\\pm\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}, z) = 0</span>。\n\n## 五、典型例题\n\n**例 1** 求过点 <span class=\"math\">(1,2,3)</span> 且垂直于向量 <span class=\"math\">(2,-1,4)</span> 的平面方程。\n\n> **解**：法向量即 <span class=\"math\">(2,-1,4)</span>，由点法式：\n> <div class=\"math\">2(x-1) - (y-2) + 4(z-3) = 0 \\Rightarrow 2x - y + 4z - 12 = 0</div>\n\n**例 2** 求点 <span class=\"math\">(1,1,1)</span> 到平面 <span class=\"math\">x + 2y + 2z - 3 = 0</span> 的距离。\n\n> **解**：\n> <div class=\"math\">d = \\frac{|1 + 2 + 2 - 3|}{\\sqrt{1 + 4 + 4}} = \\frac{2}{3}</div>\n\n## 六、易错点\n\n- 叉积 <span class=\"math\">\\vec{a}\\times\\vec{b}</span> 与 <span class=\"math\">\\vec{b}\\times\\vec{a}</span> 差一个负号，注意方向\n- 对称式中分母为 <span class=\"math\">0</span> 时应理解为对应分子为 <span class=\"math\">0</span>，写成比例式需谨慎\n\n## 相关笔记\n\n- [[高等数学 · 高阶线性微分方程]]\n- [[高等数学 · 多元函数微分法]]\n"
